omposition creates lizard/jscpd adapters but does not register complexity/duplication metrics, so AC1 needs explicit integration work; will create and link a discovered child after defining its contract. Packaging advisory already reflected by child plans: [metrics] installs lizard only; scc and jscpd remain external PATH prerequisites and docs must say so. Non-Python fixture will be pinned to Go for adapter and E2E validation.","timestamp":1784822347869686001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CLAIM 3b30-2168-ba16-41fc. Test contract card: authoritative_contract=3b30 AC + epic fallback contract; trigger_preconditions=ANALYZERS contains configured fake for happy path or lacks language for miss; production_path=rebar.metrics.analyzer public module using real AnalyzerResult/resolve/analyze_or_unavailable and registry.Unavailable; tier=in-process unit because seam is pure selection/dispatch; observable_postcondition=configured analyzer receives repo_root+languages and result passes through, miss returns exact Unavailable reason plus supplied accruing_since, result unsupported fields remain None; negative_control=configured language must not return Unavailable; collateral_invariant=import/reload does not mutate metrics REGISTRY; ci_gate=make test (focused pytest first).","timestamp":1784822448867282001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"3b30 RED evidence: focused oracle collected and executed 3 tests; all 3 failed for intended missing behavior (resolve_analyzer returned None despite configured mapping; analyze_or_unavailable raised NotImplementedError on unconfigured Go; AnalyzerResult required unsupported fields instead of defaulting None). No import/collection failures. Gate command: pytest -q tests/unit/metrics/test_analyzer.py tests/unit/metrics/test_analyzer_heldout.py. Implementer tier decision: standard/mid (gpt-5.6-terra) because protocol + dispatch contract spans typing and fail-closed semantics; attempt count required.","timestamp":1784822517923191001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"3b30 held-out GREEN: 3/3 oracle tests passed; standard-tier worker attempt_count=1. Defect-seeded mutation removed the language from the fallback reason and held-out test went RED, then implementation restored and full oracle re-passed. Refactoring litmus: tests assert only public values/calls, no source/private structure. Preflight GREEN: metrics unit 57 passed; make lint passed; make typecheck passed (370 source files); make test passed 7079, skipped 37, deselected 112 in 26m26s. Only corrective gate edit was removing an unused test import.","timestamp":1784824239630587001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"3b30 committed ed7bc9ad3 after code-review-and-quality audit and local rebar review-code PASS (0 blocking, 0 advisory). Commit has DCO, rebar-ticket trailer, Change-Id I68bc5f096c470230ee659421ef27e4ef653308ee; pushed Gerrit change 925: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/925. Awaiting LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and no unresolved comments before Submit/close.","timestamp":1784824835834381001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Created discovered integration story c23c-c32b-982c-4196 (loveydovey-mutated-wolfspider) as direct epic child to close plan-review gap: registered complexity+duplication consumers, one-run-per-context composition, honest producer-specific Unavailable, Python+Go E2E. File impact set; depends_on 0734/21fb/3ba0; a532 now depends_on c23c. Parent relation is provenance; explicit discovered_from link was rejected as correctly redundant.","timestamp":1784825039608818001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.co